Applies to the tabulated data produced by the authors:

    scan/scan24_results.txt              NEST scan output
    spectra/*.csv                        digitised beta spectra
    spectra/*_check.png                  digitisation overlays
    analysis/band_published.csv          digitised ER band of Fig. 2

The digitised files are derived measurements read off published figures by the
authors. They are NOT the original authors' data, and the underlying
calculations and figures remain the property of their publishers; see
spectra/PROVENANCE.md and notes/band-reconstruction.md. Anyone needing the
underlying values should obtain them from the cited papers.
